    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d486">

                <pb facs="0714" n="612" xml:id="pg612"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">765.84/430: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Ethiopia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">George</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Addis Ababa</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1935-07-03T12:00:00+02:35">July 3,
                            1935—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received July 3—9:40 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>50. Monday night<anchor n="29" xml:id="d486-f1"/> British Minister informed
                    Emperor that Eden had proposed to Mussolini rectification Somali frontier
                    involving cession of Ethiopian territory to Italy, to be compensated by cession
                    to Ethiopia of British port Zeila and corridor to sea, but that Mussolini had
                    rejected. British initiative was taken without consulting Emperor. Anticipate
                    fresh Ethiopian appeal for moral support of the United States and shall be
                    guided by instructions already received<anchor n="30" xml:id="d486-f2"/> in so
                    far as possible.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">George</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
